  "decision": "The two candidates establish that one redundant diagnostic snapshot can be removed. The independent query raised Windows window-32 CPU in the longer retest and WSL pinned plain-call tail latency. Returning the reason from Step raised Windows plain-call P99 and refusals at 16,000 offers/s in the three-way test. This stage keeps the baseline runtime and adds closure-ordering regression coverage.",
